@startuml
' Deployment diagram di Kickly (SDD v1.0, §3.3.1): mapping hardware/software.
' Due nodi (smartphone dell'utente e cloud Supabase) piu' tre servizi esterni:
' Stripe Connect, Firebase Cloud Messaging e servizio email.
title Kickly - Deployment diagram (SDD §3.3.1)

node "Smartphone del Giocatore / Gestore del Campo" <<device>> as Smartphone {
  ' Flutter Runtime e Secure Storage stanno dentro il sistema operativo (Android / iOS).
  node "Android / iOS" <<executionEnvironment>> as MobileOS {
    node "Flutter Runtime (Dart)" <<executionEnvironment>> as Flutter {
      artifact "Kickly (APK / IPA)" <<artifact>> as KicklyArtifact
      component "Presentation Layer\n(boundary)" as GUI
      component "Domain Layer\n(control, entity)" as Domain
      component "Data Layer\n(Repository)" as Data
      component "supabase_flutter SDK" as SupabaseFlutter
      component "firebase_messaging SDK" as FirebaseMessaging

      GUI --> Domain
      Domain --> Data
      Data --> SupabaseFlutter
      Data --> FirebaseMessaging
    }
    component "Secure Storage\n(token di sessione)" as SecureStorage
  }
}

node "Supabase Cloud (BaaS)" <<device>> as SupabaseCloud {
  node "Supabase Platform" <<executionEnvironment>> as SupabasePlatform {
    database "PostgreSQL\n(Row Level Security)" as Postgres
    ' Il client raggiunge i dati dall'API Gateway, mai direttamente dal database.
    component "API Gateway\n(REST / PostgREST)" as APIGateway
    component "Supabase Auth" as Auth
    component "Realtime" as Realtime
    node "Edge Functions (Deno)" <<executionEnvironment>> as EdgeFunctions {
      component "Gestione RSVP\n(contatore posti)" as EdgeRSVP
      component "Pagamenti e webhook Stripe" as EdgePagamenti
      component "Cancellazione account\n(GDPR)" as EdgeCancellazione
      component "Invio notifiche" as EdgeNotifiche
      component "Invio email di allerta" as EdgeEmail
    }

    APIGateway --> Postgres
    EdgeFunctions --> Postgres
  }
}

' Servizi esterni raggiunti solo da Edge Functions / Auth (server) o dal Checkout.
node "Stripe Connect" <<device>> as Stripe {
  component "Stripe API / Checkout" as StripeAPI
}

node "Firebase Cloud Messaging" <<device>> as FCM {
  component "FCM HTTP v1" as FCMService
}

node "Servizio Email" <<device>> as Email {
  component "SMTP / API email" as EmailService
}

' Comunicazione client <-> server.
Smartphone --> APIGateway : <<protocol>> HTTPS (REST / JSON)
Smartphone --> Realtime : <<protocol>> WSS (Realtime)
Smartphone --> StripeAPI : <<protocol>> HTTPS (Checkout)

' Collegamenti dal server verso i servizi esterni.
EdgePagamenti --> StripeAPI : <<protocol>> HTTPS (API REST, webhook)
EdgeNotifiche --> FCMService : <<protocol>> HTTPS
EdgeEmail --> EmailService : <<protocol>> HTTPS (API email)
FCMService --> Smartphone : <<protocol>> Push (TLS)
Auth --> EmailService : <<protocol>> SMTP (TLS)

@enduml
